  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Security fix (node-locked offline): a license.bin copied to another machine could pass local validation, because binding lives on the server and the file carries no hardware id, which local-only validation treated as \"valid anywhere\". Offline node-locked licenses now require this device to complete the online bootstrap before they may validate locally. Previous (1.8.6): SDK sends IssuedTo on online validation and refresh so the server can enforce credential matching.",
